   <refbody>
      <section id="sec_d371e7">
         <p>When you select a motor on the left navigation pane or on the List view, the application displays the motor’s information page.</p>
         <p>This page provides detailed information about the selected motor. It features the following three tabs:</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>Tab</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>Description</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Motor Status</entry>
                     <entry>View the health status of each component of the motor.</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Parameters</entry>
                     <entry>View the motor’s model information and operating parameters.</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>History Plot</entry>
                     <entry>Visualize the historical pattern of a specific motor function through graphs.</entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
         <p>Table    List of tabs that display a motor's information</p>
      </section>
   </refbody>
